    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VRMFrontView allows you to record gameplay using your own avatar. With LIV MR mode, you can overlay your VRM Avatar onto your games and simultaneously use a separate camera for a facecam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports VRM0, VRM1(experimental), vfsavatar (experimental)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SteamVR Tracker Support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SteamVR Avatar Mirror Overlay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > VMC(Virtual Motion Capture) Protocol Receiving and Transmitting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom Background (supported files: png, jpg, mp4)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hotkey mapping for Blendshapes and Camera control</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > VR Chat OSC Sending (DanceDash Bodylink Compatible)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MMD playback</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VRMFrontView allows you to record gameplay using your own avatar. With LIV MR mode, you can overlay your VRM Avatar onto your games and simultaneously use a separate camera for a facecam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports VRM0, VRM1(experimental), vfsavatar (experimental)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SteamVR Tracker Support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SteamVR Avatar Mirror Overlay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > VMC(Virtual Motion Capture) Protocol Receiving and Transmitting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom Background (supported files: png, jpg, mp4)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hotkey mapping for Blendshapes and Camera control</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > VR Chat OSC Sending (DanceDash Bodylink Compatible)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MMD playback</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "VrmFrontView: Free app for content creators/VTubers to record or stream VR gameplay with personalized VRM avatars overlaid. Supports mixed reality (e.g., LIV), VMC protocol for avatar animation, custom backgrounds, and hotkey control.",
